neYear\",\"allTime\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"requireAllTitleTerms\":{\"default\":false,\"description\":\"Set true to require every analyzed keyword term to match the video title. Recommended for person names, technical phrases, and narrow queries. Leave false for broader semantic discovery across titles, tags, and channel tags. Strict mode can return few or no results for non-English queries.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"sort\":{\"description\":\"Sort field (defaults to score)\",\"enum\":[\"breakoutScore\",\"publishedAt\",\"viewCount\",\"vph\",\"score\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"trendCategories\":{\"description\":\"Filter by trend category IDs (e.g. reaction, tier_list, mukbang). Use vidiq_trend_categories to list all available categories.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}}\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
