{"step_index":71,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:35:56Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-27T09:05:56+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-27T09:05:56+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/mcp/vidiq/vidiq_refine_thumbnail.json`\nTotal Lines: 1\nTotal Bytes: 2968\nShowing lines 1 to 1\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: {\"name\":\"vidiq_refine_thumbnail\",\"description\":\"Change or improve a YouTube thumbnail by describing what you want in plain words.\\n\\nGive it the thumbnail to change as sourceThumbnail (a hosted URL) or sourceThumbnailFile (a ChatGPT upload),\\nand say what to change (instructions) — for example \\\"make the text bigger\\\" or \\\"change the background to a\\nfootball stadium\\\".\\n\\nThis runs asynchronously: it returns an `mcpJobId` immediately. Poll `vidiq_job_poll` with that id until\\nit is \\\"completed\\\" to get the updated thumbnail (shown inline) with its imageUrl. Credits are charged on\\nsubmit and automatically refunded if refinement fails.\\n\\nInclude the imageUrl in your reply so the user can open or save the file. The inline preview isn't downloadable.\\n\\nCost: 22 credit(s) per call.\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\"properties\":{\"instructions\":{\"description\":\"What you want changed, in plain words, for example 'make the background darker' or 'make the face bigger'. Describe the change, not the whole picture.\",\"maxLength\":2000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"mask\":{\"description\":\"Optional. To change only one area and leave the rest untouched, provide a base64 image that marks the area to change.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"orientation\":{\"description\":\"Thumbnail orientation. 'landscape' is the standard 16:9 YouTube thumbnail (default when omitted); 'portrait' is a 9:16 Shorts thumbnail. Ignored when a mask is supplied (mask edits keep the source dimensions).\",\"enum\":[\"landscape\",\"portrait\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"originalConcept\":{\"description\":\"Optional. A short description of what the original thumbnail shows. Helps keep the result on-topic. If left out, your instructions are used.\",\"maxLength\":2000,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"referenceImages\":{\"description\":\"Optional. Up to 10 hosted image URLs or base64 data URIs for thumbnails whose style you'd like to copy.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"maxItems\":10,\"type\":\"array\"},\"sourceThumbnail\":{\"description\":\"The thumbnail you want to change as a hosted image URL or base64 data URI. Usually this is the imageUrl from vidiq_generate_thumbnail. Use sourceThumbnailFile instead for a ChatGPT file upload.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"sourceThumbnailFile\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"description\":\"The thumbnail you want to change as a ChatGPT-uploaded file. Use this instead of sourceThumbnail when the user uploads the source image.\",\"properties\":{\"download_url\":{\"format\":\"uri\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"file_id\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"file_name\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"mime_type\":{\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"download_url\",\"file_id\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"subjectImage\":{\"description\":\"Optional. A photo of the person who should be the main face in the thumbnail as a hosted image URL or base64 data URI.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"videoId\":{\"description\":\"Optional. The YouTube video this thumbnail is for.\",\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"instructions\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
