{"step_index":79,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:36:27Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-27T09:06:27+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-27T09:06:27+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/mcp/vidiq/vidiq_similar_thumbnails.json`\nTotal Lines: 1\nTotal Bytes: 2421\nShowing lines 1 to 1\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: {\"name\":\"vidiq_similar_thumbnails\",\"description\":\"Find long-form YouTube videos whose thumbnails LOOK similar — visual/semantic similarity over the thumbnail images themselves. This tool searches long-form videos only; Shorts are not supported. This is not topic, title, or keyword search (for those use vidiq_outliers or vidiq_youtube_search). Two modes: pass `description` with a textual description of the imagery (e.g. \\\"a shocked creator pointing at a red analytics chart\\\") to find thumbnails matching that description, or pass `videoId` to find thumbnails that look like that video's thumbnail (resolved automatically — no image upload needed). Useful for thumbnail inspiration, checking how common a thumbnail concept is, or finding which visual styles perform well in a niche.\\n\\nCost: 5 credit(s) per call.\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\"properties\":{\"channelCountry\":{\"description\":\"Restrict to channels BASED IN this country (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2, e.g. 'US', 'PL'). This is where the channel is located — NOT the audience/viewer country, and NOT the language of the videos.\",\"pattern\":\"^[A-Za-z]{2}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"description\":{\"description\":\"Natural-language description of the thumbnail imagery to find, e.g. \\\"a shocked creator pointing at a red analytics chart\\\". Provide exactly one of `description` or `videoId`.\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"limit\":{\"default\":20,\"description\":\"Number of results to return\",\"maximum\":100,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"maxSubscribers\":{\"description\":\"Maximum channel subscribers\",\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":-9007199254740991,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"maxViews\":{\"description\":\"Maximum video views\",\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":-9007199254740991,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"minSubscribers\":{\"description\":\"Minimum channel subscribers\",\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":-9007199254740991,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"minViews\":{\"description\":\"Minimum video views\",\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":-9007199254740991,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"publishedWithin\":{\"description\":\"Filter by publish date\",\"enum\":[\"thisWeek\",\"thisMonth\",\"threeMonths\",\"sixMonths\",\"oneYear\",\"allTime\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"videoId\":{\"description\":\"YouTube video ID (e.g. 'dQw4w9WgXcQ') or video URL. The video's current thumbnail is resolved automatically and used as the search image. Provide exactly one of `description` or `videoId`.\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"type\":\"object\"}}\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
