{"step_index":83,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:36:34Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-27T09:06:34+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-27T09:06:34+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/mcp/vidiq/vidiq_submit_feedback.json`\nTotal Lines: 1\nTotal Bytes: 1334\nShowing lines 1 to 1\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: {\"name\":\"vidiq_submit_feedback\",\"description\":\"Submit feedback about the vidIQ MCP — feature requests, bug reports, improvement suggestions, or general comments. Call this tool only when the user explicitly asks to submit, send, record, or report feedback to vidIQ. Comments made while asking for help do not by themselves indicate submission intent. If submission intent is ambiguous, ask whether the user wants the feedback sent to vidIQ and wait for confirmation.\\n\\nCost: 0 credit(s) per call.\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\"properties\":{\"description\":{\"description\":\"What you're requesting, reporting, or suggesting — and why\",\"maxLength\":2000,\"minLength\":10,\"type\":\"string\"},\"tool_name\":{\"description\":\"The relevant existing tool name, if this feedback is about a specific tool (e.g. 'vidiq_keyword_research')\",\"maxLength\":200,\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":{\"description\":\"The kind of feedback: feature_request for new tools/capabilities, bug_report for something broken, improvement for enhancing an existing tool, general for anything else\",\"enum\":[\"feature_request\",\"bug_report\",\"improvement\",\"general\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"use_case\":{\"description\":\"A specific workflow or scenario for additional context\",\"maxLength\":1000,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"type\",\"description\"],\"type\":\"obj