{"step_index":85,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:36:51Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-27T09:06:51+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-27T09:06:51+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/mcp/vidiq/vidiq_subscriber_insights.json`\nTotal Lines: 1\nTotal Bytes: 1136\nShowing lines 1 to 1\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: {\"name\":\"vidiq_subscriber_insights\",\"description\":\"Analyze subscriber overlap and best times to post for a YouTube channel you own.\\n\\nReturns the channels most commonly subscribed to by your audience, dated overlap history, and a timezone-adjusted histogram of sampled public YouTube activity with the strongest three-hour windows. The activity signal is not watch history or live online-presence data. Only channels authorized to your account are allowed.\\n\\nCost: 5 credit(s) per call.\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\"properties\":{\"channelId\":{\"description\":\"An owned YouTube channel ID, handle, or channel URL\",\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"limit\":{\"default\":25,\"description\":\"Maximum number of audience-overlap channels to return (1-50)\",\"maximum\":50,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"timezoneOffset\":{\"default\":\"Z\",\"description\":\"Whole-hour UTC offset used for the activity histogram: Z or ±HH:00. Fractional-hour offsets are rejected because the current upstream truncates them.\",\"pattern\":\"^(?:Z|[+-](?:(?:0\\\\d|1[0-7]):00|18:00))$\",\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"channelId\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
