{"step_index":89,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:37:00Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-27T09:07:00+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-27T09:07:01+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/mcp/vidiq/vidiq_trending_videos.json`\nTotal Lines: 1\nTotal Bytes: 3775\nShowing lines 1 to 1\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: {\"name\":\"vidiq_trending_videos\",\"description\":\"Find YouTube videos that are trending right now — gaining views rapidly based on views-per-hour velocity. Use this when someone asks: what's trending, what's hot right now, popular videos this week, or fastest-growing videos. Unlike vidiq_outliers (which measures performance vs channel average), trending measures absolute velocity — high VPH regardless of channel size.\\n\\nUse this tool to discover:\\n- Videos that are trending right now on YouTube\\n- Trending content in specific niches via title search\\n- High-performing videos filtered by views per hour, engagement, or subscriber range\\n\\nFor language-specific discovery, pass the user's requested actual video-title language in `videoTitleLanguage`. `channelCountry` only restricts where channels are based; it does not represent audience geography or video language.\\n\\nCost: 5 credit(s) per call.\",\"parameters\":{\"$schema\":\"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\"properties\":{\"channelCountry\":{\"description\":\"Restrict to channels BASED IN this country (uppercase ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code, e.g. 'US', 'PL'). This is where the channel is located — NOT the audience/viewer country, and NOT the language of the videos. To filter by the video's language, use `videoTitleLanguage` instead.\",\"pattern\":\"^[A-Z]{2}$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"limit\":{\"default\":10,\"description\":\"Number of results\",\"maximum\":50,\"minimum\":1,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"requireAllTitleTerms\":{\"default\":false,\"description\":\"Tighten titleQuery matching: when true, every term must appear in the title (strict AND), so high-velocity videos matching only a common token (e.g. 'ai') can't dominate. When false (default), titleQuery is a broad relevance signal. Only affects results when titleQuery is set.\",\"type\":\"boolean\"},\"sortBy\":{\"default\":\"relevance\",\"description\":\"Sort field\",\"enum\":[\"relevance\",\"vph\",\"viewCount\",\"engagementRate\",\"videoPublishedAt\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"subscriberCountMax\":{\"description\":\"Maximum channel subscriber count\",\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"subscriberCountMin\":{\"description\":\"Minimum channel subscriber count\",\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"titleQuery\":{\"description\":\"Search query to filter by video title (semantic search)\",\"maxLength\":500,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"videoFormat\":{\"description\":\"Video format: 'long' for regular videos, 'short' for YouTube Shorts\",\"enum\":[\"long\",\"short\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"videoPublishedAfter\":{\"description\":\"Only videos published after this date (YYYY-MM-DD)\",\"format\":\"date\",\"pattern\":\"^(?:(?:\\\\d\\\\d[2468][048]|\\\\d\\\\d[13579][26]|\\\\d\\\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\\\d|2[0-8])))$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"videoPublishedBefore\":{\"description\":\"Only videos published before this date (YYYY-MM-DD)\",\"format\":\"date\",\"pattern\":\"^(?:(?:\\\\d\\\\d[2468][048]|\\\\d\\\\d[13579][26]|\\\\d\\\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]00)-02-29|\\\\d{4}-(?:(?:0[13578]|1[02])-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|3[01])|(?:0[469]|11)-(?:0[1-9]|[12]\\\\d|30)|(?:02)-(?:0[1-9]|1\\\\d|2[0-8])))$\",\"type\":\"string\"},\"videoTitleLanguage\":{\"description\":\"Filter by detected video-title language (ISO 639-1): en, es, ja, ru, ko, ar, hi, vi, id, th, tr, de, fr, pl, pt, uk, it, mr, or fa. Use the user's requested content language; omit for all supported languages.\",\"enum\":[\"en\",\"es\",\"ja\",\"ru\",\"ko\",\"ar\",\"hi\",\"vi\",\"id\",\"th\",\"tr\",\"de\",\"fr\",\"pl\",\"pt\",\"uk\",\"it\",\"mr\",\"fa\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"viewCountMin\":{\"description\":\"Minimum video view count\",\"maximum\":9007199254740991,\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"vphMin\":{\"description\":\"Minimum views per hour\",\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"number\"}},\"required\":[\"videoFormat\"],\"type\":\"object\"}}\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
